            <description><![CDATA[<h2>MotionUI 1.3.16</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Claude and Codex now know that After Effects goes through MotionUI. The tools say so themselves, and connecting an assistant writes a short house rule into its standing instructions: work with these tools, not by clicking around the app or writing scripts. It sits between MotionUI markers, so you can take it out again.</li>
  <li>Panel 1.6.7 comes with this update.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
